.DS_Store

# history.csv / history.sql are NOT committed — they are rebuilt on demand from
# the git history of tickers/all.csv by `bun run src/gen_history_sql.ts`
# (see README → "Historical SQL archive"). A full dump is ~100 MB+ and grows
# daily, far past GitHub's 100 MB-per-file push limit, so it stays out of git.
tickers/history.csv
tickers/history.sql

# Per-ticker OHLC archives. Published to an orphan `data` branch by the daily
# workflow and served to the static site via the jsDelivr CDN — never committed
# to `main` (thousands of files / ~1GB would bloat the repo).
ohlc/
